  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Unaccompanied Migrant Children at Greek Borders  (MERIMNA III &#x2013; Protection)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to the ongoing national efforts to improve the well-being and access to fundamental rights of Unaccompanied Migrant Children (UMC) arriving at the Greek Borders  by supporting UMC living in the Safe Areas of Lesvos, Chios, Samos, Leros and Kos and Reception and Identification Center (RIC) in the region of Evros (Fylakio), to have access to immediate assistance in line with their best interest and fundamental rights.</narrative>
  </description>
